# Secrets — never commit tokens
.env
.env.*
*.token
*.pem

# Raw Airtable dumps (contain unpublished fields) and scratch output
raw/
tmp/
*.log

# Dependencies and OS noise
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# Build outputs: regenerated by `npm run build` / the Action and served from GitHub Pages.
# charities.json is NOT tracked: this repo is public, and a tracked copy would keep a permanent public
# record of every charity that has ever been listed, including any that later go undercover or ask to be
# delisted. The Action builds it fresh and publishes it to Pages only. For local work the demo page falls
# back to the live Pages copy, so no Airtable token is needed.
public/charities.json
public/img/
public/source/
public/snippet.html
public/snippet.txt
public/demo.html
design/preview-data/

# Staging folder for importing images into Airtable. Never tracked: anything committed here stays in the
# public history for good, which must never happen for an undercover charity's logo or a founder's photo.
uploads/

# Images live in Airtable (Logo / Photo attachments). A local assets/ folder is only a fallback for rows
# without an attachment and is not tracked.
assets/
